activity Conduct Risk Assessment
activity Develop Compliance Plan
activity Implement Controls
activity Monitor Compliance
activity Report Violations
activity Investigate Violations
activity Take Corrective Action
activity Review Compliance Plan
activity Approve Compliance Plan
activity Train Employees
bind Conduct Risk Assessment: Risk Level, Assessment Score
bind Develop Compliance Plan: Plan Status
bind Implement Controls: Control Type
bind Monitor Compliance: Compliance Status
bind Report Violations: Number of Violations, Reporting Channel
bind Investigate Violations: Violation Severity, Financial Impact
bind Take Corrective Action: Compliance Status
bind Review Compliance Plan: Plan Status
bind Approve Compliance Plan: Plan Status
bind Train Employees: Training Hours
Risk Level: Low, Medium, High
Compliance Status: Compliant, Non-Compliant, Pending
Violation Severity: integer between 1 and 5
Financial Impact: float between 0.0 and 1000000.0
Control Type: Preventative, Detective, Corrective
Training Hours: integer between 0 and 40
Reporting Channel: Email, Phone, Online Portal
Assessment Score: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Plan Status: Draft, Approved, Implemented
Number of Violations: integer between 0 and 100
Init[Conduct Risk Assessment] | |
End[Monitor Compliance] | |
Existence[Conduct Risk Assessment] | |
Existence[Train Employees] | |
Absence3[Report Violations] | |
Exactly[Approve Compliance Plan] | |
Responded Existence[Report Violations, Investigate Violations] | | |
Precedence[Develop Compliance Plan, Conduct Risk Assessment] |A.Risk Level in (Medium, High) | |
Precedence[Implement Controls, Approve Compliance Plan] |A.Plan Status is Approved | |
Precedence[Take Corrective Action, Investigate Violations] |A.Violation Severity > 2 | |
Response[Develop Compliance Plan, Review Compliance Plan] |A.Plan Status is Draft | |0,7,d
Response[Report Violations, Investigate Violations] |A.Number of Violations > 0 | |0,3,d
Succession[Review Compliance Plan, Approve Compliance Plan] |A.Plan Status is Draft |T.Plan Status is Approved |
Alternate Precedence[Take Corrective Action, Investigate Violations] | | |
Alternate Response[Report Violations, Investigate Violations] | | |
Chain Response[Investigate Violations, Take Corrective Action] |A.Violation Severity > 3 |T.Compliance Status is Non-Compliant |
Chain Precedence[Approve Compliance Plan, Review Compliance Plan] | | |
Co-Existence[Implement Controls, Monitor Compliance] | | |
Choice[Report Violations, Monitor Compliance] | | |
Exclusive Choice[Approve Compliance Plan, Review Compliance Plan] | | |
Not Co-Existence[Approve Compliance Plan, Report Violations] |A.Plan Status is Draft and T.Number of Violations > 5 | |
Not Responded Existence[Train Employees, Report Violations] | | |
Not Precedence[Take Corrective Action, Investigate Violations] | | |
Not Response[Monitor Compliance, Report Violations] |A.Compliance Status is Compliant | |
Not Succession[Approve Compliance Plan, Develop Compliance Plan] | | |
Not Chain Precedence[Report Violations, Train Employees] | | |
Not Chain Response[Conduct Risk Assessment, Report Violations] | | |
Not Chain Succession[Implement Controls, Report Violations] | | |